WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.312 --> 01:42.776
=Episode 12=
(Actually, You Understand Me Well)

01:56.768 --> 01:58.527
What flavor of candy are you eating?

01:59.567 --> 02:00.567
Cherry.

02:00.928 --> 02:01.928
You're lying.

02:03.328 --> 02:04.687
If you want a kiss, just tell me.

02:13.207 --> 02:14.207
What are you doing?

02:18.288 --> 02:19.288
Dad.

02:20.328 --> 02:21.328
Why are you here?

02:22.167 --> 02:23.328
It's downstairs at my door.

02:24.448 --> 02:25.448
Why is he here?

02:28.087 --> 02:29.247
I asked him to take photos.

02:29.408 --> 02:31.207
And the photos need to be confirmed.

02:32.928 --> 02:33.928
You've been away so long.

02:34.968 --> 02:35.647
Not going back?

02:35.928 --> 02:36.928
Okay.

02:50.167 --> 02:51.968
Why not return
for a follow-up this month?

02:53.567 --> 02:54.567
No time.

02:55.127 --> 02:56.127
These are all excuses.

02:57.888 --> 02:59.727
You just didn't take this matter
seriously.

03:01.207 --> 03:02.247
A patient before,

03:03.127 --> 03:04.127
counting on being young,

03:04.768 --> 03:06.448
didn't take care of his health.

03:07.328 --> 03:08.408
He checked

03:08.687 --> 03:09.687
after delaying,

03:09.888 --> 03:10.888
and almost died.

03:11.768 --> 03:12.768
I'm telling you,

03:13.207 --> 03:14.928
find time to come for a check-up.

03:15.687 --> 03:16.687
Did you hear me?

03:43.888 --> 03:45.448
Dad, thank you.

03:46.527 --> 03:47.247
Do you want milk?

03:47.448 --> 03:48.808
We have milk now.

03:49.008 --> 03:50.008
Not bad.

03:54.328 --> 03:56.008
Does Chen Luzhou have any issues?

03:59.808 --> 04:00.968
What does that

04:01.408 --> 04:02.408
have to do with you?

04:02.848 --> 04:04.008
It has nothing to do with me.

04:04.008 --> 04:05.008
No, I'm just checking.

04:05.527 --> 04:08.207
Girls shouldn't
ask these kinds of questions.

04:08.607 --> 04:09.607
Are you hungry?

04:10.167 --> 04:10.768
I'll cook.

04:11.127 --> 04:12.127
It's time to eat soon.

04:22.567 --> 04:23.567
Zhi,

04:24.288 --> 04:25.607
you've been going out lately.

04:25.848 --> 04:27.288
Have you been going to see him?

04:27.488 --> 04:28.488
No.

04:29.008 --> 04:30.167
Didn't I tell you?

04:30.167 --> 04:31.288
I'm tutoring outside.

04:33.607 --> 04:36.288
But I remember the place where you tutor

04:36.288 --> 04:37.448
is on Chunshan Road.

04:38.167 --> 04:39.167
But you come back

04:40.448 --> 04:41.968
from Yifeng Alley every time.

04:42.207 --> 04:43.448
That's two directions!

04:45.527 --> 04:46.888
I'm just going there to eat.

04:47.247 --> 04:49.008
Haven't you been eating
at the cafeteria?

04:49.527 --> 04:50.968
There was no one cooking at home.

04:51.087 --> 04:52.087
I had to go there to eat.

04:54.368 --> 04:56.207
Indeed, work has been

04:56.647 --> 04:57.687
too busy lately.

04:57.968 --> 04:58.968
How about this?

04:59.607 --> 05:02.047
I will come back early tomorrow.

05:02.047 --> 05:04.087
Starting tomorrow,
I'll come back to make dinner.

05:04.207 --> 05:06.368
After dinner and your tutoring session
are done,

05:06.368 --> 05:08.087
we have dinner at home. Okay?

05:09.768 --> 05:10.848
Ask the question again.

05:13.368 --> 05:14.647
You've been going out lately.

05:14.647 --> 05:16.127
Have you been going to see him?

05:16.368 --> 05:17.687
Yes, we're dating.

05:34.808 --> 05:36.928
Actually, you've grown up.

05:37.567 --> 05:40.687
There are some things
I shouldn't interfere with.

05:41.488 --> 05:43.448
Is it such a big deal
that we're just dating?

05:45.247 --> 05:46.727
I accept that you're dating.

05:47.247 --> 05:48.888
Because dating is a matter of time.

05:49.288 --> 05:51.247
And that boy's

05:51.247 --> 05:53.127
character is fairly decent.

05:53.408 --> 05:54.607
And he's a local.

05:55.167 --> 05:56.207
After you get married,

05:56.488 --> 05:57.449
we can have more contact

05:57.449 --> 05:59.567
since we are close.

05:59.848 --> 06:00.376
Right?

06:00.567 --> 06:01.727
Is this wine so intoxicating?

06:02.008 --> 06:03.008
You're talking nonsense.

06:03.488 --> 06:04.167
No, it's not.

06:04.488 --> 06:06.727
If you find someone far away,

06:06.928 --> 06:08.607
you won't come back home all year round.

06:09.167 --> 06:11.368
Who will I talk to when I want to?

06:11.567 --> 06:13.527
I don't want to be an empty nester.

06:13.647 --> 06:15.047
Dad, what are you talking about?

06:15.488 --> 06:16.888
I'm dating him.

06:17.008 --> 06:18.288
But we'll break up soon.

06:18.607 --> 06:19.607
He's going abroad.

06:23.448 --> 06:24.727
Chen Luzhou

06:25.567 --> 06:27.448
lives on Yifeng Alley, right?

06:36.288 --> 06:36.848
Zhi,

06:37.247 --> 06:38.328
just one word from you.

06:38.888 --> 06:40.768
I have learned it.
I will not hurt vital parts,

06:40.928 --> 06:42.408
Just let him bleed a little.

06:42.527 --> 06:43.527
Okay?

06:49.207 --> 06:50.768
No wonder it's me!

06:50.928 --> 06:52.527
That brat kept it from me for so long.

06:53.047 --> 06:54.207
Why celebrate with him?

06:56.184 --> 06:58.520
Jiang Cheng said you were dating,
but I didn't believe it.

06:59.928 --> 07:00.928
No.

07:02.888 --> 07:05.008
Congratulations on finding love.

07:09.607 --> 07:11.288
Auntie, Mom.

07:11.808 --> 07:12.808
Ms. Lian.

07:23.768 --> 07:25.008
(Did your dad deal with you?)

07:30.928 --> 07:32.449
(No, but he heard)

07:32.449 --> 07:34.008
(you'd leave me and go abroad alone.)

07:34.368 --> 07:36.448
(He was about
to take a kitchen knife to chop you.)

07:36.647 --> 07:38.968
(Fortunately,
I persuaded him out of it.)

07:40.247 --> 07:41.968
(Then let's not meet tomorrow.)

07:45.687 --> 07:47.768
(Shy Boy Chen, you're really timid.)

07:50.968 --> 07:52.087
(I'm not timid)

07:52.488 --> 07:53.488
(but cared your dad.)

07:53.928 --> 07:55.207
(Chopping people leads to jail.)

07:55.727 --> 07:57.448
(Do you dare to go to my dad
for a review?)

08:00.207 --> 08:01.288
(His professional conduct)

08:01.288 --> 08:02.928
(needs some training.)

08:06.808 --> 08:07.808
(Stop here.)

08:08.047 --> 08:09.607
(My dad seems to have drunk much.)

08:16.167 --> 08:17.568
What are you doing, Zhu Yangqi.

08:18.327 --> 08:19.327
How do you...

08:23.688 --> 08:24.688
Why are you here?

08:28.487 --> 08:29.648
Well, you guys chat first.

08:29.728 --> 08:30.888
I'll head back first.

08:31.047 --> 08:32.047
I can't save you anymore.

08:45.768 --> 08:46.768
Fell in love?

08:48.207 --> 08:48.768
Yes.

08:49.008 --> 08:50.008
Do you want to meet her?

08:52.247 --> 08:52.808
Forget it.

08:52.968 --> 08:54.087
I'm afraid you'll be angry.

08:56.287 --> 08:57.728
Study abroad visa has been issued.

08:58.608 --> 09:00.487
I'm going to Ruicheng
for a scene this Sunday.

09:01.648 --> 09:02.609
Your dad said we

09:02.609 --> 09:03.928
haven't gone on a trip.

09:04.808 --> 09:06.327
Don't take the job in Dunhuang.

09:06.447 --> 09:07.608
Take all the luggage.

09:08.167 --> 09:09.367
After the Ruicheng trip ends,

09:09.487 --> 09:10.648
go directly to your school.

09:14.768 --> 09:16.808
Don't take me along on your family trip.

09:18.447 --> 09:19.808
I'll go there myself.

09:22.568 --> 09:23.368
You've been sensible

09:23.368 --> 09:24.728
and never made me worry.

09:30.904 --> 09:32.407
I believe there will be

09:33.464 --> 09:34.904
no exception to this matter either.

09:56.047 --> 09:57.047
(Are you okay, Lucy?)

09:57.447 --> 09:58.728
(She didn't trouble you?)

09:59.367 --> 10:00.528
(I really didn't mean to.)

10:00.648 --> 10:02.207
(I thought you opened the door.)

10:02.447 --> 10:04.008
(So I let it slip.)

10:25.728 --> 10:26.888
Dad, are you okay?

10:27.688 --> 10:28.688
I'm fine.

10:28.768 --> 10:31.127
This little brat.

10:31.127 --> 10:33.688
He knew he was going abroad

10:33.848 --> 10:35.127
and still came to provoke you.

10:36.167 --> 10:38.568
You two youngsters

10:38.568 --> 10:41.008
cannot just seek momentary happiness.

10:42.968 --> 10:44.127
What is happiness?

10:44.608 --> 10:48.047
Happiness is about looking far ahead.

11:01.568 --> 11:02.808
(My dad truly drank too much.)

11:02.888 --> 11:04.247
(He's swearing at you.)

11:04.888 --> 11:06.648
(Have you decided
when to go to Dunhuang?)

11:11.008 --> 11:12.008
(Not going anymore.)

11:18.928 --> 11:21.928
(Then I'll reluctantly accompany you
for a few more days.)

11:26.407 --> 11:27.528
(My mom changed itinerary.)

11:28.127 --> 11:30.367
(Next Tuesday,
we will go to Ruicheng together,)

11:30.648 --> 11:31.648
(not back to Qingyi.)

11:38.608 --> 11:39.608
(Got it.)

11:39.848 --> 11:41.327
(Good night, Shy Boy Chen.)

11:54.608 --> 11:55.608
Zhi,

11:57.047 --> 11:58.047
why drink alcohol?

11:59.800 --> 12:01.176
- Kids can't drink alcohol.
- Dad.

12:04.888 --> 12:05.888
What's wrong?

12:13.008 --> 12:15.008
I really seem to be
a bit reluctant to let him go.

12:21.407 --> 12:22.407
It's okay.

12:34.407 --> 12:35.407
It's nothing.

12:36.287 --> 12:38.928
Some things will become better.

12:43.047 --> 12:44.367
If you're unhappy,

12:45.047 --> 12:46.047
then

12:48.087 --> 12:49.287
I will drink with you.

12:53.487 --> 12:54.487
Come on.

12:55.808 --> 12:56.808
Come on.

13:00.047 --> 13:01.367
Don't be sad.

13:02.528 --> 13:04.888
Some things will become better.

13:11.487 --> 13:12.487
Cheers.

13:34.047 --> 13:35.047
Slow down, slow down.

13:36.688 --> 13:37.688
Let me tell you.

13:37.848 --> 13:40.648
You can't drink outside anymore.

13:41.648 --> 13:43.127
I'll make you some hangover soup.

13:43.768 --> 13:44.808
Don't randomly send that.

14:01.202 --> 14:05.088
(10 things to do after graduation)

14:44.447 --> 14:45.648
(Do you have time tomorrow?)

14:45.912 --> 14:47.512
(Accompany me to get ear piercings.)

14:58.848 --> 15:00.688
This little brat.

15:01.968 --> 15:03.648
He's coming for a follow-up examination.

15:04.087 --> 15:05.447
I'll teach him a lesson.

15:20.818 --> 15:23.960
(Qingyi City Central Hospital)

15:23.960 --> 15:25.071
(Chief Physician, Xu Guangji)

15:28.928 --> 15:29.928
Come in.

15:31.648 --> 15:32.648
Uncle.

15:34.608 --> 15:35.688
Who's your uncle?

15:36.968 --> 15:37.968
Dr. Xu.

15:38.287 --> 15:39.287
Where's medical record?

15:45.528 --> 15:47.207
I heard you're going abroad.

15:50.327 --> 15:51.648
Let me show you something.

15:55.808 --> 15:57.528
Hello everyone, my name is Xu Zhi.

15:57.648 --> 15:59.207
Napoleon once said that

15:59.327 --> 16:01.968
a soldier who doesn't
want to be a general isn't a good one.

16:02.568 --> 16:05.247
Although I am not as rich as Lin Zixuan,

16:05.447 --> 16:07.087
I'm pretty.

16:07.487 --> 16:10.367
Lin Zixuan's money
won't all be spent on you.

16:10.648 --> 16:13.407
But my beauty is completely unreserved.

16:13.568 --> 16:14.848
You all can see it.

16:14.848 --> 16:16.327
I hope all vote for me.

16:16.808 --> 16:19.367
But if I am elected
as the class president,

16:19.648 --> 16:21.528
I hope everyone
can cooperate with me in work.

16:21.608 --> 16:22.848
Don't make this hard for me.

16:23.127 --> 16:24.127
Thank you all.

16:28.008 --> 16:29.008
How about that?

16:29.648 --> 16:31.087
Isn't my daughter very confident?

16:32.407 --> 16:33.407
Confident and generous.

16:33.487 --> 16:34.648
You raised her very well.

16:34.928 --> 16:37.688
But last night, she cried and said,

16:38.487 --> 16:41.608
"Dad, am I really that bad?"

16:42.608 --> 16:45.367
"I can't even keep my own boyfriend."

16:45.487 --> 16:48.047
"I'm really useless."

16:50.207 --> 16:52.047
Dad, when did I ever say that?

16:55.487 --> 16:56.287
This patient,

16:56.287 --> 16:57.287
why not knock on door?

16:57.928 --> 16:59.888
You have the patient
bring you a meal card?

17:00.888 --> 17:03.207
Even if my own father

17:03.207 --> 17:04.447
has to knock the door.

17:05.087 --> 17:07.327
Okay, I'm your father.

17:10.528 --> 17:12.167
Guangji, I'm here.

17:15.608 --> 17:16.608
Stand firm.

17:17.608 --> 17:18.287
The report's out.

17:18.287 --> 17:19.287
Take a look.

17:22.848 --> 17:24.528
What are you looking at, young girl?

17:24.528 --> 17:26.648
- I need to know the situation.
- Girls shouldn't look.

17:27.728 --> 17:28.728
Go wait for me outside.

17:37.968 --> 17:39.648
Who do you want her to wait for outside?

17:41.287 --> 17:42.287
Wait for you.

17:43.207 --> 17:44.207
Forget it.

17:44.768 --> 17:45.768
I heard it too.

17:46.568 --> 17:47.688
Where

17:48.287 --> 17:49.447
are you two going?

17:49.447 --> 17:50.447
Tell me.

17:51.087 --> 17:52.247
Join her for an ear-piercing.

17:59.808 --> 18:01.127
Actually, when she was little,

18:02.447 --> 18:04.327
I also took her to get her ears pierced.

18:05.207 --> 18:06.608
But each time we got halfway,

18:06.968 --> 18:07.968
we went back home.

18:10.127 --> 18:11.487
She is very afraid of pain.

18:13.888 --> 18:15.728
And she loved to act spoiled.

18:16.928 --> 18:18.407
But after her mother left,

18:18.528 --> 18:19.688
she completely changed.

18:20.608 --> 18:22.447
Except for some trivial matters,

18:22.447 --> 18:24.848
she stopped telling me a lot of things.

18:25.768 --> 18:26.768
Maybe

18:27.367 --> 18:29.127
I didn't give her sense of security.

18:32.327 --> 18:34.447
Am I a failed father?

18:37.087 --> 18:38.608
Mr. Xu, I think this is...

18:39.127 --> 18:41.247
But even as a failed father,

18:42.608 --> 18:44.528
my fists are still strong.

18:48.848 --> 18:50.247
Don't bully my daughter,

18:51.127 --> 18:52.528
or I will beat you to death.

18:59.167 --> 19:00.167
If you want to leave, go.

19:01.568 --> 19:02.888
Don't dawdle.

19:08.008 --> 19:09.008
Okay.

19:11.608 --> 19:12.888
How is your report?

19:14.247 --> 19:15.247
So curious?

19:17.327 --> 19:17.928
Alright,

19:18.247 --> 19:19.247
I'll show you.

19:26.848 --> 19:28.167
What does this mean?

19:29.207 --> 19:30.048
Simply put,

19:30.048 --> 19:31.367
it's an excellent

19:31.367 --> 19:33.968
sperm analysis report
of a male high school graduate.

19:34.848 --> 19:35.848
Narcissist.

19:36.247 --> 19:37.247
I'm narcissistic?

19:37.528 --> 19:38.368
I've never said

19:38.368 --> 19:40.608
such things like
my beauty is unreserved.

19:41.167 --> 19:42.568
My dad showed you the video?

19:43.127 --> 19:45.688
Yeah, but my favorite part
is still that line.

19:45.848 --> 19:47.512
"If I am elected
as the class president,"

19:47.512 --> 19:49.208
"I hope you
can cooperate with me in work."

19:49.208 --> 19:50.608
"Don't make this hard for me."

19:52.447 --> 19:53.447
Xu Zhi,

19:53.528 --> 19:55.568
you were so boastful and cute
when you were little.

19:55.568 --> 19:56.568
Right?

19:56.768 --> 19:58.648
If we had met when we were little,

19:58.888 --> 20:00.928
you would have been bowing at
my diapered feet.

20:06.487 --> 20:07.487
Disagree with that?

20:07.968 --> 20:10.528
Yes, I am afraid
you'd steal my diapers to wear.

20:11.568 --> 20:12.968
You really understand me.

21:09.327 --> 21:10.776
(Actually, you understand me well.)

21:11.728 --> 21:13.208
(You're afraid I'll be in a dilemma.)

21:13.496 --> 21:15.447
(So you've never tried
to persuade me to stay.)

21:37.728 --> 21:38.728
Looking at earrings?

21:40.008 --> 21:41.568
Here's one that suits you quite well.

21:42.008 --> 21:43.008
Take a look.

21:46.127 --> 21:47.127
There's also a new model.

21:49.247 --> 21:50.407
This one is so cute.

21:51.688 --> 21:52.688
Nice.

21:59.528 --> 22:00.968
Why don't you help me choose?

22:01.688 --> 22:02.688
I choose?

22:03.528 --> 22:05.447
I've never chosen
a gift for a girl. You sure?

22:11.928 --> 22:12.928
How about this one?

22:14.167 --> 22:15.167
When hungry, gnaw on it.

22:16.487 --> 22:17.768
You're so scheming.

22:17.768 --> 22:18.968
You want me to put it on

22:18.968 --> 22:20.087
and think of you, do you?

22:22.728 --> 22:23.247
Alright.

22:23.327 --> 22:24.327
Let me take a look.

22:27.047 --> 22:28.047
How about this one?

22:29.528 --> 22:30.528
Is this okay?

22:39.096 --> 22:42.632
♪On a midsummer night♪

22:43.032 --> 22:48.078
♪The streetlights gradually awaken♪

22:50.688 --> 22:51.688
This one.

22:52.688 --> 22:53.728
This one?

22:53.728 --> 22:54.728
It's suitable for you.

22:55.688 --> 22:56.968
After the piercing is done,

22:56.968 --> 22:58.087
don't get it wet today.

22:58.487 --> 22:59.447
Wear it two days later.

22:59.447 --> 23:00.047
Okay.

23:00.047 --> 23:01.047
Let me disinfect it.

23:04.087 --> 23:05.087
Come, sit here.

23:05.087 --> 23:07.346
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

23:07.346 --> 23:10.064
♪The whole world pauses♪

23:10.584 --> 23:13.098
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

23:15.224 --> 23:17.278
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

23:17.816 --> 23:20.556
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

23:20.556 --> 23:22.609
♪Falling into your eyes♪

23:23.000 --> 23:25.387
♪Oh oh oh♪

23:26.688 --> 23:27.447
After you go back,

23:27.447 --> 23:28.447
avoid touching water.

23:28.568 --> 23:29.568
Okay.

23:29.568 --> 23:31.198
♪Like the universe's response♪

23:31.506 --> 23:32.910
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

23:34.287 --> 23:35.416
(I'm going out for a bit.)

23:35.528 --> 23:36.528
(Wait for me here.)

23:38.130 --> 23:42.200
♪Ah ah ah♪

23:43.512 --> 23:47.972
♪We met across billions of light-years♪

23:47.972 --> 23:55.970
♪Ah ah ah♪

23:56.447 --> 23:57.608
You went to buy an umbrella?

23:59.247 --> 24:00.247
The store manager said

24:00.768 --> 24:02.127
you must not get the piercing wet.

24:03.447 --> 24:04.848
Then what is this?

24:05.447 --> 24:06.487
Some expert once said

24:06.487 --> 24:08.568
eating ice cream could
ease the ear-piercing pain.

24:08.568 --> 24:10.407
Is this expert's last name Chen?

24:13.048 --> 24:16.600
♪Reuniting in this familiar rain♪

24:16.696 --> 24:19.192
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

24:19.320 --> 24:21.752
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

24:21.848 --> 24:25.650
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

24:25.650 --> 24:27.712
♪The whole world pauses♪

24:32.407 --> 24:33.808
Just say it if you want to eat.

24:37.808 --> 24:38.808
Is it cold?

24:39.568 --> 24:40.728
Let's watch sunrise tomorrow.

24:41.688 --> 24:42.688
Tomorrow?

24:44.207 --> 24:46.047
I might be busy tomorrow and can't go.

24:46.327 --> 24:46.928
Then forget it.

24:47.127 --> 24:48.367
I have to work tomorrow.

24:48.768 --> 24:50.424
And you still want
to catch the sunrise?

24:50.688 --> 24:51.688
Can you wake up early?

24:51.928 --> 24:52.929
Of course, I can.

24:52.929 --> 24:54.487
During my junior year, I always slept

24:54.487 --> 24:55.487
and woke up early.

24:59.608 --> 25:00.608
Don't believe me?

25:01.087 --> 25:01.688
I believe you.

25:01.928 --> 25:03.367
That's how I imagined you'd be.

25:05.008 --> 25:06.008
What about you?

25:06.728 --> 25:07.728
I'm opposite of you.

25:08.728 --> 25:10.688
I always stayed up late
before going to sleep.

25:10.888 --> 25:11.849
At eight,

25:11.849 --> 25:13.008
I went to morning self-study.

25:13.816 --> 25:16.127
You stayed up late?
I thought you were disciplined.

25:16.127 --> 25:17.447
You drink lemon water at bars.

25:18.487 --> 25:19.768
Just the junior year.

25:22.528 --> 25:24.688
So even naturally talented people
have to work hard.

25:25.087 --> 25:27.528
I thought you could achieve top scores
just by lying down.

25:27.768 --> 25:28.768
How is that possible?

25:29.207 --> 25:30.528
In the junior year,

25:30.768 --> 25:32.407
I did a lot of exercises.

25:33.407 --> 25:34.928
So how many points did you score?

25:35.407 --> 25:36.407
292.

25:36.728 --> 25:37.728
That's so high!

25:38.367 --> 25:39.367
It's just so-so.

25:41.928 --> 25:44.127
I probably won't meet anyone
who can score

25:44.127 --> 25:45.888
over 290 points
in comprehensive science.

25:50.688 --> 25:51.688
Let's stop here.

25:51.968 --> 25:52.808
If Xu sees us,

25:52.808 --> 25:53.808
he'll scare you.

25:54.568 --> 25:56.207
Bye-bye. Are you eating?

25:56.367 --> 25:56.968
It's all yours.

25:57.127 --> 25:58.127
Have this.

25:58.247 --> 25:59.247
Alright, bye-bye.

26:09.968 --> 26:10.968
(In the future,)

26:11.568 --> 26:12.928
(I probably won't come across)

26:12.928 --> 26:14.207
(a girl like you again.)

26:33.968 --> 26:34.968
(Are you free tomorrow?)

27:04.167 --> 27:05.167
Luzhou.

27:05.768 --> 27:06.768
Where's my mom?

27:07.367 --> 27:09.087
She took Xingqi to the sketch class.

27:09.568 --> 27:11.087
It's just the two of us today.

27:11.327 --> 27:12.327
Sit down and eat.

27:14.207 --> 27:15.207
Okay.

27:20.087 --> 27:21.087
Have some rice.

27:33.287 --> 27:35.648
I don't know
if it's because I'm getting older,

27:37.047 --> 27:38.608
or because you're going abroad,

27:40.528 --> 27:42.087
but I've been dreaming of the days

27:43.008 --> 27:44.447
when you first came to this family.

27:46.008 --> 27:47.047
At that time,

27:48.648 --> 27:49.808
you were just this tall.

27:52.247 --> 27:53.928
Time really flies.

27:55.087 --> 27:57.688
In the blink of an eye,
you're taller than me.

28:11.407 --> 28:12.808
(Luzhou, come on.)

28:12.808 --> 28:14.447
(Change your shoes first.)

28:20.327 --> 28:21.327
Quick, look.

28:21.648 --> 28:22.448
In the future,

28:22.448 --> 28:24.008
this will be your new home.

28:24.447 --> 28:25.688
We will live here.

28:27.047 --> 28:27.672
Do you like it?

28:34.648 --> 28:36.688
Honey.

28:36.792 --> 28:37.247
Coming.

28:37.247 --> 28:37.808
We are back.

28:37.808 --> 28:38.808
Coming.

28:40.407 --> 28:42.167
It's okay. Don't be afraid.

28:42.327 --> 28:43.327
I'm here.

28:43.608 --> 28:44.608
Hello, Luzhou.

28:46.127 --> 28:47.167
This is for you.

28:49.528 --> 28:50.528
Take it. Look.

28:51.008 --> 28:52.247
A gift your dad bought for you.

28:53.287 --> 28:54.287
Take it.

28:57.247 --> 28:58.247
Do you like it?

29:01.287 --> 29:02.287
Do you like it?

29:06.127 --> 29:07.127
So good.

29:07.808 --> 29:10.047
Let's go.
I will take you to play over there.

29:10.768 --> 29:12.207
It's okay. I'm with you.

29:12.407 --> 29:13.247
Don't be afraid.

29:13.247 --> 29:13.928
Don't be afraid.

29:14.247 --> 29:14.768
Let's go.

29:14.768 --> 29:16.848
Let's go.
There are lots and lots of toys.

29:32.487 --> 29:33.487
Here.

29:34.047 --> 29:35.327
The key to the apartment.

29:46.648 --> 29:47.648
Luzhou,

29:49.968 --> 29:51.207
you don't

29:52.848 --> 29:54.087
want to go abroad?

29:56.247 --> 29:57.247
Yes, I do.

29:58.207 --> 29:59.207
Going abroad is good.

30:01.968 --> 30:02.968
Yes.

30:04.688 --> 30:07.087
Go out and see the world.

30:07.087 --> 30:08.087
It's always good.

30:09.888 --> 30:11.247
But no matter where you go,

30:12.247 --> 30:13.287
in Qingyi,

30:13.728 --> 30:15.087
you'll always have family.

30:16.008 --> 30:17.407
You can visit when you're free.

30:21.447 --> 30:22.368
After I go abroad,

30:22.368 --> 30:23.736
I might settle down there.

30:24.568 --> 30:25.568
I won't come back often.

31:33.768 --> 31:35.447
Hello, Chen Luzhou.

31:35.808 --> 31:37.487
What's up?

31:38.688 --> 31:39.688
Nothing.

31:39.768 --> 31:41.247
I just want to hear your voice.

31:42.447 --> 31:43.447
What are you doing?

31:44.728 --> 31:45.768
I'm preparing lessons.

31:45.768 --> 31:47.447
I have to tutor after dinner.

31:49.888 --> 31:51.769
Alright, carry on with your work.

31:51.769 --> 31:53.247
Let's talk after that.

31:53.568 --> 31:54.568
Bye.

32:14.407 --> 32:15.407
Where are you going?

32:16.608 --> 32:17.609
I'm going out.

32:17.609 --> 32:18.648
I won't eat dinner.

32:29.407 --> 32:31.247
Surely to find Chen Luzhou again.

32:33.487 --> 32:35.207
Can't keep a grown-up daughter at home.

32:53.568 --> 32:54.568
Hello.

32:58.002 --> 32:58.584
Hi.

33:00.407 --> 33:01.407
Why are you here?

33:02.008 --> 33:03.528
Didn't you want to hear my voice?

33:03.968 --> 33:06.808
I'll give you
a live surround sound experience.

33:09.447 --> 33:10.447
Not to tutor?

33:11.207 --> 33:12.287
There is a child here

33:12.287 --> 33:14.087
who needs more of my care.

33:18.728 --> 33:19.808
Stop here. Let's go.

33:21.167 --> 33:22.207
You have someone at home.

33:24.207 --> 33:25.487
What team is being matched?

33:30.167 --> 33:31.688
Stop pretending.

33:32.608 --> 33:34.287
I just ranked up a little.

33:34.367 --> 33:35.528
You two were hugging already.

33:37.928 --> 33:39.848
Why not tell me
there's someone at home?

33:40.447 --> 33:41.448
You came too suddenly.

33:41.448 --> 33:43.087
I didn't have the time.

33:43.888 --> 33:46.528
Tell me, who started it first?

33:47.928 --> 33:48.928
Was it you?

33:53.008 --> 33:55.447
Based on what I know about
that brat Chen Luzhou,

33:55.728 --> 33:57.728
he definitely
wouldn't provoke you at this time.

33:58.688 --> 33:59.728
Why?

34:00.728 --> 34:01.447
Because

34:01.528 --> 34:02.728
he's about to go abroad soon.

34:02.728 --> 34:03.728
He wouldn't dare.

34:04.008 --> 34:05.008
So annoying.

34:05.568 --> 34:06.728
What's it got to do with you?

34:12.327 --> 34:13.487
Now you find me annoying.

34:16.648 --> 34:18.087
Fine, I'll leave, alright?

34:23.568 --> 34:25.127
Maybe I should go back first.

34:25.968 --> 34:27.087
Call him back.

34:27.688 --> 34:29.087
You're in a long-term relationship.

34:29.087 --> 34:31.224
- Don't argue over me.
- It's not related to you.

34:32.047 --> 34:34.247
When I had to study out of town
in middle school,

34:34.528 --> 34:35.528
he was nitpicking

34:36.167 --> 34:37.247
over nothing like this too.

34:38.207 --> 34:39.728
You guys also quarreled back then?

34:41.928 --> 34:43.808
He hoped I could ask Chen Jishen

34:44.327 --> 34:45.207
to intervene like him,

34:45.207 --> 34:46.247
so that I could stay.

34:48.008 --> 34:48.688
I didn't agree.

34:49.008 --> 34:50.008
Then we quarreled.

34:51.167 --> 34:53.688
As a child, he'd plead with his dad
whenever he messed up.

34:53.968 --> 34:55.087
His dad always forgave him.

34:57.127 --> 34:58.127
But he didn't know

34:58.528 --> 34:59.688
my dad and his dad

35:00.287 --> 35:01.287
are different people.

35:03.928 --> 35:05.447
Then what is he going to do now?

35:07.287 --> 35:08.287
It's nothing.

35:26.167 --> 35:27.247
That's about it.

35:29.127 --> 35:30.127
Must I coax you?

35:31.087 --> 35:32.167
Who cares?

35:33.768 --> 35:35.327
I'll buy you two chicken strips.

35:36.287 --> 35:37.287
Do you two want it spicy?

35:38.407 --> 35:39.407
No.

35:39.928 --> 35:41.008
I'll get you a spicy one

35:41.008 --> 35:42.008
to knock your socks off!

35:45.127 --> 35:46.327
Bring back a drink.

35:47.087 --> 35:48.087
Got it.

35:57.808 --> 35:59.327
You know him well.

36:01.327 --> 36:02.568
He acts this way when sad.

36:02.568 --> 36:03.568
I'm used to it.

36:11.247 --> 36:12.247
You know what?

36:12.848 --> 36:13.848
Actually,

36:13.968 --> 36:15.367
the first time we met

36:15.367 --> 36:16.528
was not at your door.

36:17.528 --> 36:18.528
Then when was it?

36:19.688 --> 36:20.688
In my freshman year.

36:20.808 --> 36:21.808
Freshman year?

36:23.608 --> 36:24.648
How come I don't remember?

36:26.648 --> 36:28.888
In our school's basketball league,

36:29.167 --> 36:31.047
our first match was against your school.

36:32.407 --> 36:34.768
I had to deliver water
to the athletics committee.

36:36.447 --> 36:39.008
I saw you standing
at the edge of the basketball court

36:39.848 --> 36:42.207
and talking to the girls in your class.

36:43.367 --> 36:44.367
And then?

36:45.207 --> 36:47.568
I wanted to ask you to deliver water
to athletics committee.

36:47.728 --> 36:48.407
But you

36:48.728 --> 36:49.944
mistook me for your fan.

36:50.287 --> 36:51.528
You just drank it.

36:51.528 --> 36:52.648
Aren't you narcissistic?

36:57.888 --> 36:59.047
You may get the wrong person.

36:59.608 --> 37:01.447
I don't talk to girls
when playing basketball.

37:01.648 --> 37:03.008
Probably not.

37:04.287 --> 37:05.367
During the recording,

37:05.367 --> 37:06.367
I even saw that girl.

37:06.768 --> 37:09.008
She is the one taking photos

37:09.008 --> 37:10.008
next to you.

37:10.407 --> 37:11.407
She looked pretty good.

37:11.528 --> 37:13.487
Her name is Zhang Yu.

37:18.808 --> 37:19.808
Are you jealous?

37:20.247 --> 37:23.247
Back then,
I didn't feel anything for you at all.

37:24.487 --> 37:25.928
When did you first feel anything?

37:26.367 --> 37:27.367
What about you?

37:28.808 --> 37:29.928
From the first glance.

37:32.568 --> 37:33.808
But,

37:34.232 --> 37:35.960
I didn't believe in love at first sight.

37:36.688 --> 37:38.127
And I thought you had a boyfriend.

37:38.568 --> 37:39.608
I didn't think of it.

37:42.087 --> 37:44.287
Aren't you thinking about it
differently now?

37:52.728 --> 37:53.728
Stop being so cheeky.

37:54.487 --> 37:55.528
I'll go take a shower.

37:55.528 --> 37:57.047
See a movie and I'll take you back.

37:58.247 --> 37:59.247
Can you leave door open?

38:00.648 --> 38:01.648
In your dreams.

38:11.008 --> 38:12.968
If on that day
when we played basketball,

38:13.816 --> 38:14.768
I asked for your name,

38:14.768 --> 38:15.768
would you have told me?

38:16.968 --> 38:20.008
I would. I'd even become
your WeChat friend.

38:21.648 --> 38:22.688
Why?

38:22.688 --> 38:24.688
So that you can
pay for that bottle of water.

38:31.407 --> 38:33.008
Lucy, I'm back.

38:33.688 --> 38:34.688
Look who's here.

38:35.087 --> 38:36.688
- Surprise.
- Surprise.

38:38.167 --> 38:38.688
Wait. How...

38:38.688 --> 38:39.688
How did you all...

38:40.207 --> 38:41.608
They heard you were going abroad,

38:41.608 --> 38:42.840
so they came to bid farewell.

38:44.367 --> 38:45.367
Come on, come on.

38:45.487 --> 38:46.487
Jiang Cheng,

38:46.928 --> 38:47.928
don't move this chair.

38:48.367 --> 38:50.167
Stingy. Fine, I won't move it.

38:50.167 --> 38:51.167
Why care that?

38:54.136 --> 38:54.968
Gu Yan is here too.

38:54.968 --> 38:55.808
I run into her

38:55.808 --> 38:56.648
at the store,

38:56.648 --> 38:57.648
so she came along too.

38:58.367 --> 38:59.367
Come in and sit down.

38:59.648 --> 39:00.367
Come on, sit.

39:00.648 --> 39:01.648
Long time no see.

39:02.127 --> 39:02.648
Yeah.

39:03.047 --> 39:04.287
Didn't expect to see you here.

39:04.664 --> 39:05.848
Why isn't Cai Yingying here?

39:06.207 --> 39:07.968
She's preparing for
her art exams.

39:08.207 --> 39:09.207
So she couldn't come.

39:09.568 --> 39:10.888
Art exams? What major?

39:11.768 --> 39:12.768
Broadcast hosting.

39:13.528 --> 39:14.648
I'm good at this.

39:15.367 --> 39:16.568
I've also taken that exam.

39:16.568 --> 39:17.728
Maybe I can give her some

39:17.728 --> 39:19.008
immature suggestions.

39:19.008 --> 39:19.889
Really?

39:19.889 --> 39:21.568
I'll create a group chat for you later,

39:21.808 --> 39:22.688
so you two can chat.

39:22.688 --> 39:23.688
Okay.

39:25.487 --> 39:26.968
It seems like they get along well.

39:27.928 --> 39:28.928
Go take a shower at ease.

39:29.207 --> 39:30.447
Don't be so sloppy?

39:31.008 --> 39:32.008
Okay, fine.

39:35.327 --> 39:36.327
Come on.

39:36.928 --> 39:38.608
Drinks and such are all in the fridge.

39:38.968 --> 39:39.768
Have fun.

39:39.928 --> 39:41.087
Only kids drink this.

39:41.087 --> 39:42.087
Take a sip.

39:45.944 --> 39:47.167
What are you playing with?

39:47.167 --> 39:49.688
Pretty Lu, sing a song.

39:49.912 --> 39:52.127
We haven't heard you sing for long.
Sing a song.

39:53.047 --> 39:53.649
Do one.

39:53.649 --> 39:55.352
I just come out and you make me sing.

39:56.207 --> 39:56.768
Sing a song.

39:56.768 --> 39:57.808
I'll choose for you.

39:57.808 --> 39:58.360
Come on.

39:58.487 --> 39:59.487
- Pick one.
- Pick one.

39:59.487 --> 40:00.487
- Pick one.
- Zhu.

40:12.888 --> 40:17.207
♪Both of us lack something♪

40:20.528 --> 40:25.608
♪That's why we instantly become unhappy♪

40:26.768 --> 40:29.768
♪Simplicity is difficult♪

40:30.367 --> 40:33.367
♪There are many burdens♪

40:34.047 --> 40:36.407
♪Though very brave♪

40:37.008 --> 40:40.528
♪We are still sad♪

40:42.447 --> 40:47.167
♪Many things have choices♪

40:49.968 --> 40:55.247
♪Only afterwards do I often understand♪

40:56.247 --> 40:59.407
♪I have emotions♪

40:59.848 --> 41:03.127
♪And my words are abrasive♪

41:03.728 --> 41:06.447
♪Communication between people♪

41:07.087 --> 41:10.127
♪Doesn't always go smoothly♪

41:10.407 --> 41:14.407
♪Perhaps only you understand me♪

41:14.407 --> 41:18.047
♪Therefore, you didn't escape♪

41:18.487 --> 41:22.127
♪While crying, you tightly hug me♪

41:22.127 --> 41:26.528
♪Whispering how much you love me♪

41:26.528 --> 41:29.568
♪Only you understand me♪

41:29.568 --> 41:33.447
♪Like a trapped beast♪

41:33.768 --> 41:39.327
♪In skyscrapers, longing for freedom♪

41:42.367 --> 41:44.247
Why does this guy sing so well?

41:44.247 --> 41:45.568
I can never get tired of it?

41:45.568 --> 41:47.247
Really.

41:47.247 --> 41:48.728
Check if he could debut.

41:49.848 --> 41:50.848
Absolute center position.

41:53.367 --> 41:54.968
Come on, let's toast to that.

41:55.487 --> 41:56.487
Come on.

42:02.808 --> 42:04.447
Why am I so sad?

42:04.528 --> 42:05.528
Lucy.

42:05.808 --> 42:08.367
Do you remember
the last time you went out of town?

42:09.287 --> 42:12.367
No one reminded me
to wear a uniform on Mondays.

42:13.888 --> 42:15.247
No one reminded me

42:15.608 --> 42:17.784
when you played cards,
trumps were all on the far left.

42:18.728 --> 42:21.608
No one competed with me on
who practiced more.

42:24.928 --> 42:27.008
(Dad)
How come I miss you before you leave?

42:27.008 --> 42:28.008
Right, Zhi?

42:30.207 --> 42:31.648
It's my dad calling. Let me take it.

42:35.447 --> 42:36.447
Zhu, where's your song?

42:37.167 --> 42:37.809
I do have one.

42:37.809 --> 42:39.256
- Then sing it.
- The one you always sing.

42:39.728 --> 42:41.447
- Crow.
- Yes, Crow.

42:42.127 --> 42:43.928
We thought of the same thing, come on.

42:43.928 --> 42:45.568
Again, come on, come on.

42:46.487 --> 42:48.928
♪Crow, crow, crow, crow♪

42:48.928 --> 42:51.008
♪Chirp, chirp, chirp, chirp♪

42:51.008 --> 42:53.447
♪Hehehe, hahaha.♪

42:53.447 --> 42:55.167
♪The world is generally false♪

42:55.167 --> 42:56.528
May I go home later?

42:57.367 --> 42:58.688
Why not just sleep at his place?

42:59.047 --> 43:00.287
Don't go back. It's so late.

43:00.487 --> 43:01.168
Is it okay?

43:01.168 --> 43:02.447
What?

43:02.768 --> 43:04.047
You really want to stay there?

43:04.487 --> 43:06.047
Let that guy answer the phone.

43:09.127 --> 43:09.688
How is it?

43:09.968 --> 43:10.689
Impressive?

43:10.689 --> 43:12.167
Sure, Zhu.

43:12.888 --> 43:14.447
Isn't it? Another one.

43:15.808 --> 43:16.447
Uncle.

43:16.688 --> 43:17.688
Uncle?

43:17.848 --> 43:18.848
Don't you

43:18.928 --> 43:19.928
want to live anymore?

43:20.407 --> 43:22.008
Hurry up, send her back.

43:23.287 --> 43:24.287
Alright.

43:26.648 --> 43:27.768
What did Xu say?

43:29.407 --> 43:32.047
He asked if I've tasted the violence.

43:41.968 --> 43:43.367
Can I see

43:43.367 --> 43:44.407
what I didn't see now?

43:45.407 --> 43:46.407
You wish.

43:48.447 --> 43:49.447
Let's watch a movie.

43:49.808 --> 43:50.968
You can see everything there.

44:17.280 --> 44:24.280
(Actually, you understand me well.
You're afraid I'll be in a dilemma.)

44:24.280 --> 44:29.743
(So you've never tried
to persuade me to stay.)

44:31.024 --> 44:36.840
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

44:37.392 --> 44:42.920
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

44:44.432 --> 44:48.880
♪The world is too quiet♪

44:49.872 --> 44:56.800
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

44:57.712 --> 45:02.800
♪Who will visit me♪

45:03.856 --> 45:09.480
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

45:10.224 --> 45:13.280
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

45:13.520 --> 45:18.840
♪Into concern and care♪

45:24.368 --> 45:29.480
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

45:30.000 --> 45:35.840
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

45:37.296 --> 45:40.680
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

45:40.816 --> 45:47.040
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

45:47.536 --> 45:50.480
♪The lonely clock♪

45:50.640 --> 45:55.240
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

45:55.632 --> 45:58.880
